{
  "_about": "Pages and keys of the generated profile for the Boeing 737 MAX 8 that comes with MSFS 2024, in the form of cj4.json and visionjet-sf50.json (see c172-g1000.json's _about: positions row,column; each key copies a real saved template and changes only the fields under 'set', 'shell' and the title). Positions, variables, events and formats are the tables of docs/b737-max8.md, built from the 737's input event list (docs/reference/InputEvents-737MAX8.txt) and three captures of what its cockpit controls drive. 7 pages: main has its own grid round the mode control panel, with the folder keys TRIM, VIEWS and SIM RATE where the other profiles have them; MCP, LIGHTS and PED are its other pages; trim, views and simrate are the CJ4's pages as they are (trim with this profile's hold codes of XL24-B737.lua). Main 2,8 and 4,8 are Empty and kept for OVHD and MORE. Not yet sim-tested.",
